    "silentFilterWarning": "公开 LoRA 发到不兼容模型会被上游静默过滤 → 画布必须在不兼容模型上隐藏挂载，避免假生效",
    "personalIncompatible": "400（不静默）",
    "strengthRange": {
      "krea2": "可为负（双极）",
      "personal": "(0, 1]"
    },
    "serverClamp": "TypeDoc：values outside the valid range are clamped server-side",
    "fieldsVerified": {
      "status": "已核（SDK 文档，2026-10-16 12:30:53 抓取）",
      "source": "https://sdk-docs.sogni.ai/interfaces/_internal_.BaseProjectParams.html",
      "loras": "string[]，按串联顺序",
      "loraStrengths": "number[]，与 loras 按位置对应，省略默认 1.0，可为负",
      "gaps": [
        "REST 接口参考页没列这些字段（只有 SDK 类型定义）",
